        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Very frustrated. Came to get my front tires aligned, and they wanted 1600$ to align and a thousand other things. When I came to get the car (because I’m not paying that ridiculous amount) AN HOUR before closing, he says “I don’t have the time to put on 4 bolts”.\nThere are 5 mechanics there, and no one can put on 4 bolts?? Afterwards, he proceeded to be extremely rude and throw insults.\nThey still have my car. This is illegal.\nI should’ve and might call the cops.",
        "time": 1763826930,
        "translated": false
